  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LQlQFBH9/images/63094b4b88c4f5123af0bcd24ef4f741b1224ee5.png\" alt=\"堆疊方塊：農夫樂事\"></p>\n<p><strong>結合農夫樂事的繩索與堆疊方塊，輕鬆進行合成！</strong> 此堆疊方塊的附加模組可讓您使用農夫樂事的繩索來壓縮方塊，製作出捆綁堆疊。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-farmers-delight/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.1&showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新版\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a></p>\n<h2>🧺 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用農夫樂事的繩索壓縮木頭原木、石頭、下界岩、西瓜等方塊。</li>\n<li>合成堆疊肥沃土壤，非常適合後續種植作物。</li>\n<li>為您的農場資源騰出寶貴的箱子空間。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>✨ 無縫整合</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>只需合成繩索，即可用來製作可堆疊方塊！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處下載農夫樂事</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"正在存錢買筆電！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐贈按鈕\"></a></p>",
